+# DWC3 xHCI IMOD test image
+
+Image: `firmware-dwc3-imod-20261027`
+
+```text
+sysupgrade.bin
+  65316958a739a61c41d52e4b983464ef4ccbacbb6b70a341d33fabc5eab4996b
+```
+
+Change:
+
+```dts
+&usb1_dwc3 {
+	imod-interval-ns = <5000>;
+};
+```
+
+This is baseline DWC3 TX threshold 4, not the previous 8/8 experiment.
+
+Expected after boot:
+
+```text
+GTXTHRCFG = 0x24080000    (TXPKTCNT=4, baseline)
+IR0_IMOD  = 0x00000014    (5000ns / 250ns = 20)
+```
+
+Previous baseline:
+
+```text
+IR0_IMOD  = 0x000000a0    (40000ns / 250ns = 160)
+```
+
+Test:
+
+```text
+1. boot and read GTXTHRCFG / IR0_IMOD
+2. 4-stream iperf3 downlink
+3. 4-stream iperf3 uplink
+4. dmesg for xHCI errors
+5. compare against 184/277 baseline
+```
+
+DWC3 TX threshold 8/8 was already tested:
+
+```text
+GTXTHRCFG = 0x28080000
+down 185 / up 277
+```
+
+It did not improve downlink.
+
+Measured:
+
+```text
+GTXTHRCFG = 0x24080000
+IR0_IMOD  = 0x00000014
+down 183 / up 270
+```
+
+Baseline was 184 / 277.  IMOD 40us -> 5us is not the bottleneck.
