@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
+# RTL8812AU USB TX aggregation experiment
+
+Status: REJECTED, not active.
+
+Patch:
+
+```text
+0001-rtw88-8812a-test-txagg-REJECTED.patch
+```
+
+Change:
+
+```diff
+- .usb_tx_agg_desc_num = 1,
++ .usb_tx_agg_desc_num = 3,
+```
+
+## Why rejected
+
+In the vendor rtl8812au driver:
+
+```c
+pHalData->UsbTxAggDescNum = 6;
+if (IS_HARDWARE_TYPE_8812AU(padapter))
+	/* adjust value for OQT Overflow issue */
+	pHalData->UsbTxAggDescNum = 0x01;
+```
+
+The vendor deliberately limits the 8812AU TX aggregation descriptor to 1
+to avoid an OQT overflow.  Upstream rtw88's value 1 agrees with that vendor
+workaround.  Setting 3 is not a safe performance fix.
+
+The patch was compile-tested only, then removed from the active build.
+No test firmware was produced from it.
